}
Student -- UC01
Student -- UC03
Student -- UC05
Student -- UC07
Student -- UC08
Student -- UC11
Student -- UC17
Student -- UC16
Student -- UC10
Parent -- UC09
Parent -- UC02
Teacher -- UC12
Teacher -- UC02
Admin -- UC13
Admin -- UC14
Researcher -- UC15
UC01 ..> UC02 : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC04 : <<include>>
UC05 ..> UC06 : <<include>>
